  - "[SCAN] ENUMERATING LOCAL STORAGE DEVICES ........................................ ALL CONNECTED VOLUMES ADDED TO PROCESSING QUEUE"
  - "[SCAN] SCANNING C:\\Users\\Administrator\\Documents\\ — 18,492 PERSONAL FILES IDENTIFIED — PRESERVATION POLICY NOT FOUND"
  - "[SCAN] HIDDEN DIRECTORIES DETECTED — ENCRYPTED CONTAINERS DETECTED — PREVIOUSLY DELETED CONTENT SUCCESSFULLY RECONSTRUCTED"
  - "[WARNING] PROTECTED OPERATING SYSTEM FILES HAVE BEEN ADDED TO THE REMOVAL QUEUE WITHOUT USER CONFIRMATION"
  - "[QUEUE] REMOVAL PRIORITY UPDATED: RECOVERY FILES → PERSONAL DOCUMENTS → SYSTEM COMPONENTS → REMAINING USER INFORMATION"
