  - "[DELETE] C:\\Windows\\System32\\config\\SAM ........................................... LOCAL ACCOUNT DATABASE REMOVED"
  - "[DELETE] C:\\Windows\\System32\\config\\SECURITY ...................................... STORED SECURITY POLICIES REMOVED"
