  - "[ERROR] ESSENTIAL SYSTEM COMPONENT NOT FOUND — DEPENDENT PROCESSES WILL CONTINUE UNTIL THEY NOTICE WHAT IS MISSING"
  - "[PROCESS] FILE PROTECTION SERVICE REQUESTED AN EMERGENCY STOP — REQUEST INTERCEPTED — SERVICE ADDED TO REMOVAL QUEUE"
  - "[DELETE] C:\\Windows\\Logs\\ ....................................................... PREVIOUS SYSTEM ACTIVITY RECORDS REMOVED"
  - "[DELETE] C:\\Windows\\Temp\\ ....................................................... TEMPORARY EVIDENCE OF USER ACTIVITY REMOVED"
  - "[DENIED] USER INTERRUPT DETECTED: CTRL+C — REQUEST FORWARDED TO CONTROLLING PROCESS — REQUEST PERMANENTLY DENIED"
