  - "[DELETE] C:\\Users\\Administrator\\Documents\\Journal\\ ................................ PRIVATE ENTRIES REMOVED — UNREAD ENTRIES FOUND"
  - "[WARNING] DOCUMENT CONTENT CHANGED DURING DELETION — LAST MODIFIED BY UNKNOWN USER — LAST OPENED FROM INSIDE THIS PROCESS"
