  - "[DELETE] C:\\System Volume Information\\ .......................................... REMAINING RESTORATION DATA REMOVED"
  - "[RECOVERY] EMERGENCY REPAIR FAILED — ORIGINAL STATE COULD NOT BE DETERMINED — CURRENT STATE ACCEPTED AS ORIGINAL STATE"
