  - "[ACCESS] REQUESTING RELEASE OF LOCKED IDENTITY DATA ................................ CURRENT HOLDER HAS DECLINED TO LET YOU GO"
  - "[SCAN] ATTEMPTING TO IDENTIFY REMAINING FILE OWNER ............................... OWNER LOCATED ON THE OTHER SIDE OF THE SCREEN"
